OL,3,APolice officer guilty of series of
OL,4,Arapes and sex attacks over 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Police Scotland officer has
OL,7,Fbeen convicted of a catalogue of sex
OL,8,Fcrimes, including two counts of rape,
OL,9,Fover a 17-year period.
OL,11,FCampbell Petrie, 50, was found guilty
OL,12,Fof nine charges at the High Court in
OL,13,FGlasgow, which took place between 2006
OL,14,Fand 2023.
OL,16,FPetrie was a serving officer at the
OL,17,Ftime of the offences, which included
OL,18,Findecent assault, assault with intent
OL,19,Fto rape and assault to injury and
OL,20,Fdanger of life.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
